  "limitations": [
    "One top-level pair of manual approval branches with distinct literal messages and failFast false; no branch workspace or result bindings.",
    "Native pending inputs prove overlapping suspension and join before continuation. Automated test decisions do not establish human authorization.",
    "Rejection is observed on the originating input while the sibling remains paused, then propagated after the sibling decision; no cancellation certification.",
    "No nested parallelism, arbitrary branch work, public support promotion or portable execution. The disposable runtime host and observer remain trusted."
